Package: save
Version: 1.1.7-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Boniface <opiobonniky@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Standalone client for the Download Me backend
 Inspect videos, select formats and retrieve server-prepared downloads.
 Requires a reachable Download Me API. The client embeds its runtime;
 no Node.js, Python, yt-dlp or ffmpeg installation is needed.
